{"publicId":"2e39b812-6ab5-49de-bddb-5a93a3fa671b","title":"Apache修补Anthropic发现的HTTP/2漏洞","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-14T06:47:41.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-14T06:47:41.000Z","digest":"Apache修复了由Anthropic的OSS Scanner和两位Google Cloud研究员发现的允许未认证攻击者在HTTP/2服务器上运行代码的严重漏洞。该漏洞影响HTTP/2启用且未配置身份验证的Apache服务器，可能导致未授权代码执行。Apache已发布补丁，但早先称漏洞影响所有未认证访问，后续研究指出仅特定配置下存在风险，两者均引用内部评估。\n\n该漏洞存在于2026年11月14日之前发布的Apache版本中，修复后需重新编译应用。Apache未披露受影响服务器的具体数量，但确认已通过GitHub安全标签同步更新代码。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-14T07:41:14.944Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Apache 修复 Anthropic 扫描器发现的严重漏洞","latestReport":{"id":"vcg8ge8ierd52s2g2iosn06ph"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fMrQZfe-Sn6A","title":"Apache Patches Critical Bug","firstReportAt":"2026-11-14T06:47:41.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"vcg8ge8ierd52s2g2iosn06ph","title":"Apache 修复 Anthropic 扫描器发现的严重漏洞","summary":"Apache 因 Anthropic 的 OSS Scanner 和两位 Google Cloud 研究员的发现，修复了一个可以让未认证攻击者在 HTTP/2 启用的服务器上运行代码的严重漏洞。","source":{"name":"The Defiant","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-14T06:47:41.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"vcg8ge8ierd52s2g2iosn06ph","title":"Apache 修复 Anthropic 扫描器发现的严重漏洞","summary":"Apache 因 Anthropic 的 OSS Scanner 和两位 Google Cloud 研究员的发现，修复了一个可以让未认证攻击者在 HTTP/2 启用的服务器上运行代码的严重漏洞。","source":{"name":"The Defiant","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-14T06:47:41.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-14T08:00:00.000Z","heat":9.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T09:00:00.000Z","heat":9.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T10:00:00.000Z","heat":9.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T11:00:00.000Z","heat":8.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T12:00:00.000Z","heat":8.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T13:00:00.000Z","heat":8.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T14:00:00.000Z","heat":8